  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 18,
      "learn": [
        "Separable verbs have a stressed prefix: <b>auf</b>, <b>ein</b>, <b>an</b>, <b>ab</b>, <b>mit</b>.",
        "In a statement the conjugated verb is in position 2 and the prefix goes to the <b>end</b>.",
        "Er <b>steht</b> um sieben Uhr <b>auf</b>. Er <b>nimmt</b> die Tablette <b>ein</b>.",
        "In a yes/no question the verb is first and the prefix is still at the end: <b>Steht</b> er <b>auf</b>?"
      ],
      "vocab": [
        {
          "de": "Tablette",
          "article": "die",
          "plural": "die Tabletten",
          "en": "tablet — einnehmen",
          "emoji": "💊",
